<template><div class="neural-wrap" :data-ready="ready" :data-rendered-nodes="visibleCount" :data-rendered-edges="edgeCount" :data-flow-particles="flows.length" :data-loaded-previews="loadedPreviews" :data-display-mode="exhibit?'seal-exhibit':'neural'"><div ref="holder" class="neural-webgl"></div><div v-if="!compact" class="neural-hud"><span>印脉 · 资料星图</span><b>{{visibleCount}} NODES <i>／</i> {{edgeCount}} LINKS</b><small>空间位置用于组织资料，光流表示已登记关系</small></div><div v-if="hover" class="neural-tooltip" :style="{left:hover.x+'px',top:hover.y+'px'}"><strong>{{hover.name}}</strong><span>{{hover.kind}} · {{hover.degree}} 条当前关联</span></div><div v-if="!compact" class="neural-tools"><button :aria-pressed="paused" @click="paused=!paused"><IconPlayerPlay v-if="paused" :size="15"/><IconPlayerPause v-else :size="15"/>{{paused?(exhibit?'播放动效':'播放光流'):(exhibit?'暂停动效':'暂停光流')}}</button><button :aria-pressed="bloomEnabled" @click="bloomEnabled=!bloomEnabled"><IconSparkles :size="15"/>{{exhibit?'柔光':'泛光'}}</button><button :aria-pressed="labelsEnabled" @click="labelsEnabled=!labelsEnabled"><IconEye :size="15"/>{{exhibit?'文字':'标签'}}</button><button @click="fit"><IconFocus2 :size="15"/>{{exhibit?'归位':'全览'}}</button></div><div v-if="!compact" class="neural-guide"><IconRotate :size="14"/> 拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 点击查看 <span v-if="!exhibit">{{fps}} FPS</span></div><div v-if="problem" class="neural-problem" role="alert"><p>{{problem}}</p><button @click="emit('fallback')">使用二维图谱</button></div><div v-else-if="ready&&!visibleCount" class="neural-problem"><p>当前筛选没有匹配的节点</p><small>调整搜索或来源后继续探索</small></div></div></template>
